	)
	(text "R45: PGOOD pullup (open drain), read on PC3.\nOn USB power alone the buck is off and PGOOD may\nstill read high: firmware checks VBAT_SENSE instead.\nR46/R47: VBUS sense, 5 V gives 3.0 V on PB2.\nConnect USB D+ only while VBUS_SENSE is high.\nR48: holds VBUS at 0 V with no host plugged in\n(same fix as stellaNova R22)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 388.62 340.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
